From: Scott Miller <152090551+seelesturm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:39:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): check merged waves before the first merge

Check touched packages in a disposable detached worktree. Exclude compiler diagnostic owners and check the remaining wave again. Pin the missing-field regression with real Git and Cargo.

Co-authored-by: Coder (gpt-6.1-sol) <coder@localhost>

Fixes #3459
